        "file": "test-cases/eslint-snippets/fixture/executor-library-terminal/dynamicControls.ts",
        "line": 42,
        "message": "This adapter hides write from SQL analysis (arity or rest). Call the executor on the SQL text (`write(sql)`, or `const exec = write; exec(sql)`). `byIdAppended(id, column, write)` is not a judged rewrite: analysis does not follow an executor passed as a value. Write the direct call explicitly. Analysis cannot check SQL that only reaches the executor through this adapter.",
        "messageId": "blocked",
        "ruleId": "no-mistakes/postgres-no-executor-adapter",
